<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay farming to grow one pct in '96 - Cenbank.</title>
<headline>Paraguay farming to grow one pct in '96 - Cenbank.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguayan agricultural activity should expand by one percent in 1996, the Central Bank said Tuesday.</p>
<p>But this growth will be down from 11.5 percent growth in 1995, it said in its monthly report on economic activity.</p>
<p>-- Jose Maria Amarilla, Asuncion Newsroom +59521 444527</p>
</text>
